                                                "sense_id": "9e64ec1b-9feb-375e-b182-cdacc47ff8c4",
                                                "text": "\"Well, I did my best. I had no hopes, and it has worked out as I thought. It is a pure waste of time.\" \"Not at all,\" Malone answered. \"It has ventilated an evil. There were reporters in court. Surely some of them have some sense. They will note the injustice.\""
